# The org's .github repo provides these for every Example-Org repo.
.github/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
.github/CONTRIBUTING.md
.github/SECURITY.md
.github/SUPPORT.md
.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE
.github/DISCUSSION_TEMPLATE
# No sponsor button for the org.
.github/FUNDING.yml
# The hub's gitleaks config allowlists README.md; the org scrub and the PR
# Checks step run gitleaks with no path allowlist instead.
.gitleaks.toml
